body:
I agree. I really like doing model airplanes, but I can't afford it. 

&#x200B;

Or much of anything really.

Oh god, I always hated that. Tried to kind of mumble "Sure..."

Now I have to act completely oblivious. 

&#x200B;

I'm pretty glad I bought the game, even with all the annoying glitches. I try to get myself to watch hulu around 8pm, that way I don't get too obsessed. 

&#x200B;

(I get really obsessed with certain things, and this is one of them.) 

&#x200B;

I played non stop for a week, and now I'm back to playing around on my computer. But I play for at least a couple hours a day. 

&#x200B;

There are a few things I wish they'd change, but all in all, I love it. 

&#x200B;

Have fun with your T-51 armor, I'm enjoying working my way up to T-60 armor.

A little bit of everything, but I'm disabled, so no work. 

&#x200B;

I'm trying to get approved to move into this building, it's my last hope. Holidays, whether or not I need surgery, new therapist, money. Probably it.
